真正走近，正好戳中你一直有的那层“隔”。你当时是当场就愣住了，还是过后越想越不是滋味？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2687,"promptTokens":3361,"completionTokens":177,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:49"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":29,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014060049505183726,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66aa1f4429d1fd72f65ea","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534049081,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66aa1f4429d1fd72f65ea","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"说的是我啊。（语气有点冲）可我怎么听怎么别扭，像是在夸，又像是在说我假、说我跟谁都隔着一层。<第14轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":28,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014060049505183726,"emotions":[{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":4,"sort":7},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":3,"sort":5},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":0,"sort":4},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":0,"sort":6}],"relationId":"6af66aa1f4429d1fd72f65eb","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534049078,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66a9cf4429d1fd72f65e9","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"嗯，一句话能搁在心里这么久，说明它戳到的地方不浅。听起来像是被那句话定了性，又不好当面反驳。那句“没有人能和她交往不来”，说的是你，还是别的人？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"嗯，一句话能搁在心里这么久，说明它戳到的地方不浅。听起来像是被那句话定了性，又不好当面反驳。那句“没有人能和她交往不来”，说的是你，还是别的人？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2309,"promptTokens":2663,"completionTokens":104,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:44"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":27,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010983642353953426,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66a9cf4429d1fd72f65e8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534044996,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66a9cf4429d1fd72f65e8","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"松一点了……（缓了缓）其实我想说，前阵子有个同事说了句话，我到现在都过不去。他说“没有人能和她交往不来”。<第13轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":26,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010983642353953426,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":3,"sort":7},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":1,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2}],"relationId":"6af66a9cf4429d1fd72f65e9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534044993,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66a99f4429d1fd72f65e4","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"不习惯也没关系，你能在我面前这样，已经是很信任的一步了。我们不急，你可以缓一缓。现在心里松一点了，还是仍然有点紧？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"不习惯也没关系，你能在我面前这样，已经是很信任的一步了。我们不急，你可以缓一缓。现在心里松一点了，还是仍然有点紧？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1792,"promptTokens":2655,"completionTokens":62,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:41"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":25,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01243024986306978,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66a99f4429d1fd72f65e3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534041681,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66a99f4429d1fd72f65e3","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（吸了吸鼻子，别过头）都有点吧……（停顿）其实我不太习惯在别人面前这样。<第12轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01243024986306978,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af66a99f4429d1fd72f65e4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534041678,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:41","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66a96f4429d1fd72f65e1","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"想哭不奇怪，那句话像是碰到了很久没被碰过的地方。在这里你不用忍着，想哭就哭一会儿，我陪着你。这眼泪里，更多的是一种委屈，还是被人看见之后的松动？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"想哭不奇怪，那句话像是碰到了很久没被碰过的地方。在这里你不用忍着，想哭就哭一会儿，我陪着你。这眼泪里，更多的是一种委屈，还是被人看见之后的松动？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1754,"promptTokens":2599,"completionTokens":73,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:38"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":23,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014057658312747504,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66a96f4429d1fd72f65e0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534038954,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:38","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66a96f4429d1fd72f65e0","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（愣了一下，声音有点哑）累不累……好像真没人问过。（沉默片刻）你这么一问，我反倒有点想哭，挺奇怪的。<第11轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":22,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014057658312747504,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":6,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":6,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":3,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":3,"sort":5},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":2,"sort":2},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":1,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af66a96f4429d1fd72f65e1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534038951,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:38","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66a94f4429d1fd72f65db","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"嗯，“考好一点他们就没话说了”，然后一路做到现在别人挑不出毛病，可心里是空的。听起来你很早就学会了用“做得好”换一点安宁，但那安宁里好像没有人真的看看你。这些年，有没有谁问过你一句“累不累”？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"嗯，“考好一点他们就没话说了”，然后一路做到现在别人挑不出毛病，可心里是空的。听起来你很早就学会了用“做得好”换一点安宁，但那安宁里好像没有人真的看看你。这些年，有没有谁问过你一句“累不累”？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":3434,"promptTokens":2466,"completionTokens":239,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:36"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":21,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014057642796034879,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66a94f4429d1fd72f65da","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534036248,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66a94f4429d1fd72f65da","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"就自己憋着呗。躲房间里，或者拼命学习，考好一点他们就没话说了。（苦笑）所以现在工作也是，做得好好的，别人挑不出毛病，可心里……还是空的。<第10轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014057642796034879,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":7,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":7,"sort":9},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":4,"sort":7},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":2,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":1,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af66a94f4429d1fd72f65db","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534036245,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66a8ff4429d1fd72f65d6","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"嗯，“说了也没人真的想听”，这句话听着挺让人心里一沉的。在自己家里还得这样掂量着说话，久了确实会累。那时候的你，遇到这些说不出口的时候，一般会怎么消化呢？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"嗯，“说了也没人真的想听”，这句话听着挺让人心里一沉的。在自己家里还得这样掂量着说话，久了确实会累。那时候的你，遇到这些说不出口的时候，一般会怎么消化呢？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2261,"promptTokens":2932,"completionTokens":131,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:31"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0040696362026127015,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66a8ff4429d1fd72f65d5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534031685,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:31","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66a8ff4429d1fd72f65d5","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（低头）都有吧。在我家，说什么都得先想清楚会不会让爸妈失望。他们对我期望很高，考不好、做不好，那种眼神……（语气低下去）反正说了也没人真的想听。<第9轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":18,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0040696362026127015,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":7,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":7,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":5,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af66a8ff4429d1fd72f65d6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534031683,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:31","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66a8cf4429d1fd72f65ce","chatId":"85bdd4c7c6194d7684fedb1515403f58","sessionId":null,"userId":99773,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"嗯，能说到“从小就得小心”，已经不容易了。你说太长了，我不逼你，我们可以慢慢来。只是我想知道，刚才停住的那一下，是觉得说了也没用，还是有点怕说下去？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"嗯，能说到“从小就得小心”，已经不容易了。你说太长了，我不逼你，我们可以慢慢来。只是我想知道，刚才停住的那一下，是觉得说了也没用，还是有点怕说下去？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2460,"promptTokens":2205,"completionTokens":158,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:28"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":17,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004608444204929839,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66a8cf4429d1fd72f65cd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794534028080,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:40:28","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"